     "body": "<p>Entity definitions for most characters can be found in one of these files:<br/>\n<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml-lat1.ent\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml-lat1.ent</a><br/>\n<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml-special.ent\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml-special.ent</a><br/>\n<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml-symbol.ent\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml-symbol.ent</a></p>\n\n<p>These are all combined into a DTD here: <a href=\"http://gv.ca/dtd/character-entities.dtd\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://gv.ca/dtd/character-entities.dtd</a></p>",
