      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Resolution:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>not support non-core xml entity references for inline xml datastream</li>\n\t<li>recommend &#163;, directlky enter the character,</li>\n\t<li>spit out a client-side warning, saying that if it finds any that look like non-supported entity references.</li>\n\t<li>update docs to make this known.</li>\n</ul>\n",
     "created": "15/Sep/09 2:15 PM",
